      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the entities sending such charter buses to the City often fail to provide sufficient advance notice, or any advance notice, to the City of the arrival of such buses and often fail to provide any information about the number, household size, language needs, and other potential needs of the passengers; and",
