        409,
        1504,
        637
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the arrival of such charter buses in the City, containing large numbers of individuals who have recently arrived in the United States from other nations and who are likely to seek emergency shelter and other immediate services, without advance notice of the timing of arrival and location where such buses will disembark and without any information about the passengers on such buses, significantly impairs the City's ability to effectively and efficiently manage the ongoing state of emergency;",
