        1507,
        1755
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "(a) **Notification.** Any such operator must provide notice of the anticipated date and time of arrival of their charter bus in New York City and the information required by paragraph (b) of this section to the Commissioner of Emergency Management or their designee (\"the Commissioner\") by emailing busnotices@oem.nyc.gov at least 32 hours in advance of such anticipated date and time of arrival, except as provided in paragraph (e) of this section.",
